  "releaseNotes": "LensPairingView no longer shows a caption by default; set Label to add one. The receiver drops an offer that a newer one replaces mid-negotiation and tags its answer with the offer's id, so a phone that re-offers no longer receives a stale answer. Smaller embedded logo. From 1.2.0: the pairing token persists in TokenFile, so a phone reconnects by itself, and RepairAsync issues a new one; DisconnectPhoneAsync puts the receiver on hold (IsOnHold) and ConnectPhone brings the phone back without a QR scan; PhoneMode.Document saves shots to DocumentFolder and raises DocumentSaved.",
